4651:  /// Drives the caret blink. Period ~530ms, toggling [value] between 0 and 1.
4652:  /// Uses a real [Timer] rather than an [AnimationController]+ticker so the
4653:  /// repeating blink does not keep the frame scheduler busy — this lets tests
4654:  /// (and idle frames) settle. The timer only fires on real time progress, so
4655:  /// headless `pump()`/`pumpAndSettle()` without a duration are not blocked.
4656:  Timer? _blinkTimer;
4657:
4658:  /// Current blink phase: 1.0 = caret visible, 0.0 = caret hidden. Toggled by
