4667:  /// The layout service for this surface. Prefers the editor-level
4668:  /// [SharedTextLayoutCache] (so the laid-out painter survives a virtualised
4669:  /// remount); falls back to a private instance when no scope is present (e.g.
4670:  /// in tests that mount the surface in isolation).
4671:  TextLayoutService get _layoutService {
